{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hant",
  "strings": {
    "%@失敗（錯誤代碼 %@）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ failed (error %2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@失敗（錯誤代碼 %d）。請確認已允許拾音「錄製系統音訊」": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ failed (error %d). Make sure Shiyin is allowed to record system audio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@（自動）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ (Auto)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "- 企業伺服器：%@（伺服器 %@）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- Enterprise server: %@ (server %@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "- 拾音 %@（build %@）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- Shiyin %1$@ (build %2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "- 顯示卡：%@；whisper：%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- Graphics: %1$@; whisper: %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API key 存在 Windows 的認證管理員，不會寫進任何檔案。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API keys are stored in Windows Credential Manager and never written to any file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Breeze ASR 25（建議）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Breeze ASR 25 (recommended)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code（這台電腦已經裝了 claude CLI）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code (the claude CLI is installed on this PC)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex（這台電腦已經裝了 codex CLI）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex (the codex CLI is installed on this PC)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NVIDIA 顯示卡加速下載好了，重新開啟拾音後，轉錄就會用顯示卡": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NVIDIA GPU acceleration is ready. Reopen Shiyin to transcribe on the GPU."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NVIDIA 顯示卡加速（CUDA）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NVIDIA GPU acceleration (CUDA)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NVIDIA 顯示卡加速：轉錄會快很多，685 MB（解開約 1.1 GB）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NVIDIA GPU acceleration: much faster transcription, 685 MB (about 1.1 GB unpacked)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF 和 docx 的段落標題使用明體；Markdown 適合貼到 Notion、GitHub。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PDF and docx use a serif font for section headings; Markdown is good for pasting into Notion or GitHub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qwen3-ASR 的 NVIDIA 顯示卡加速（CUDA）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NVIDIA GPU acceleration for Qwen3-ASR (CUDA)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qwen3-ASR 的轉錄程式（llama-server）出錯，請再試一次；一直失敗的話到設定改回 Breeze": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Qwen3-ASR transcription program (llama-server) failed. Try again; if it keeps failing, switch back to Breeze in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WAV 缺少格式區段": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The WAV file has no format chunk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows 解不開 .%@ 的檔案：請先轉成 m4a、mp3 或 wav 再匯入（ogg、opus 可以從 Microsoft Store 安裝「Web 媒體延伸模組」）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Windows can’t decode .%@ files. Convert it to m4a, mp3, or wav and import again (for ogg and opus, install “Web Media Extensions” from the Microsoft Store)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoom、Teams、Webex、Google Meet（瀏覽器）等開始用麥克風、拾音沒在錄音時提醒你；會議結束時提醒停止。只提醒，不會自動錄音。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When Zoom, Teams, Webex, Google Meet (in a browser) or a similar app starts using the microphone and Shiyin isn't recording, Shiyin asks whether to record, and asks again when the meeting seems to end. It only asks; it never records on its own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "claude 沒有回傳結果（結束代碼 %lld）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "claude returned no result (exit code %lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "codex 沒有回傳結果（結束代碼 %lld）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "codex returned no result (exit code %lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 沒有讓拾音讀取鑰匙圈裡的 API key。再試一次時，系統詢問就輸入這台 Mac 的登入密碼（不是 API key），按「永遠允許」；或到設定 → 整理工具重新貼上 key。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS didn’t let Shiyin read the API key from the keychain. Try again, and when macOS asks, enter this Mac’s login password (not the API key) and click “Always Allow”. Or paste the key again in Settings → Summarizer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「待確認」列出整理時沒把握的人名、專有名詞、負責人和期限。在「你的回答」欄位直接回答，按「送出」，會議紀錄就會依你的答案修正；看不懂或不重要的勾「略過」。也可以在「摘要」按「編輯」直接改。改錯了可以從「更多」選「復原上一版會議紀錄」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“To confirm” lists names, terms, owners and deadlines the summarizer wasn't sure about. Type in “Your answer” and click “Submit”, and the notes are revised from your answers; check “Skip” for anything unclear or unimportant. You can also click “Edit” in “Summary” to change things directly. To undo a mistake, choose “Revert to previous notes” from “More”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「待確認」列出整理時沒把握的人名、專有名詞、負責人和期限。紀錄裡有疑問的那一條旁邊會有「？」，點了就能當場回答；也可以到「待確認」分頁一次看完。能用是或否回答的直接按「是」「不是」（按「是」不用等整理工具），其他的在「你的回答」欄位回答，按「送出」，會議紀錄就會依你的答案修正；看不懂或不重要的按「略過」，或一次「全部略過」。也可以在「摘要」按「編輯」直接改。改錯了可以從「更多」選「復原上一版會議紀錄」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“To confirm” lists the names, terms, owners and deadlines the summarizer wasn’t sure about. The note in question gets a “?” next to it: click it to answer right there, or open the “To confirm” tab to go through them all. Questions that take yes or no have “Yes” and “No” buttons (“Yes” confirms on the spot, no waiting for the summarizer); answer the others in “Your answer”, then click “Submit” and the notes are revised to match. Click “Skip” on anything unclear or unimportant, or “Skip all”. You can also edit the notes directly with “Edit” on the Summary tab. If something goes wrong, choose “Restore previous notes” from “More”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「說話者」：拾音認識的人和他們的聲紋，可以改名、刪除，或關掉記住聲音的功能。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Speakers”: the people Shiyin knows and their voiceprints. Rename or delete them, or turn off remembering voices."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「說話者與詞彙」：拾音認識的人和他們的聲紋，可以改名、刪除，或關掉記住聲音的功能；詞彙表加入系統名、產品名、人名的正確寫法，這對專有名詞的正確率影響很大。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speakers & Glossary: the people Shiyin recognizes and their voiceprints, which you can rename or delete, or turn off remembering voices; the glossary holds the correct spelling of system names, product names and people's names, which greatly improves proper-noun accuracy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「進階」：填更新網址、檢查更新；有新版時拾音會詢問，同意後自動下載、驗證並重新打開。也可以從「拾音」選單選「檢查更新…」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Advanced”: enter the update URL and check for updates. When a new version is available, Shiyin asks, then downloads, verifies and reopens. You can also choose “Check for Updates…” from the Shiyin menu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「進階」：檢查更新（有新版時拾音會詢問，同意後自動下載、驗證並重新打開；也可以從「拾音」選單選「檢查更新…」）、環境檢查、錄音和模型佔用的空間。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Advanced: check for updates (when a new version is available Shiyin asks, then downloads, verifies and relaunches; also available from the Shiyin menu → Check for Updates…), environment check, and the space used by recordings and models."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "・匯入：把錄音檔拖進視窗，或按「匯入」（Ctrl+O）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Import: drag a recording into the window, or click Import (Ctrl+O)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "・拾音會常駐在工作列右下角的系統匣，關掉視窗也會繼續錄音和整理。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Shiyin stays in the system tray at the bottom right of the taskbar; closing the window keeps recording and processing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "・錄音：側欄上方的「錄音」（Ctrl+R），或在其他 app 裡按 Ctrl+Alt+Shift+R": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Record: click Record at the top of the sidebar (Ctrl+R), or press Ctrl+Alt+Shift+R in any app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下載的壓縮檔裡少了需要的檔案，請重新下載": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The downloaded archive is missing required files. Please download it again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下載的檔案不完整": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The download is incomplete"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不支援 %lld 位元": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld-bit audio is not supported"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不支援的 WAV 格式 %lld": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unsupported WAV format %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不是%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "中文、英文可選的引擎（阿里巴巴開源），約 2.5 GB，含 llama.cpp 的執行檔；「正式轉錄」選了它才會用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional engine for Chinese and English (open-sourced by Alibaba), about 2.5 GB including the llama.cpp program; used only when selected under Final transcription."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "之後隨時可以從「輔助說明」選單（⌘?）或選單列的拾音圖示，再打開這份說明。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can open this guide again any time from the Help menu (⌘?) or the Shiyin icon in the menu bar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "之後隨時可以從系統匣或設定的「進階」再打開使用說明。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can open this guide again any time from the system tray or Settings → Advanced."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "人多、吵雜或手機放在桌上錄音時，先告訴拾音大約幾個人，說話者會分得比較準": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With many people, noise, or a phone on the table, telling Shiyin roughly how many people there are helps it tell speakers apart"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "介面": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Interface"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "介面語言": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Interface language"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "企業伺服器的憑證不受這台電腦信任，請公司的管理者協助安裝憑證": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This computer doesn't trust the enterprise server's certificate. Ask your company's administrator to install it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "企業伺服器要求轉到別的網址（HTTP %lld），拾音不會跟著轉。請確認網址，或請公司的管理者檢查伺服器的設定。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The enterprise server asked to redirect to another address (HTTP %lld). Shiyin doesn't follow redirects. Check the URL, or ask your company's administrator to check the server settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "企業伺服器辨識說話者": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Identifying speakers on the enterprise server"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：「上個月跟客戶談過哪些價格？」「寄信的機制最後怎麼決定的？」拾音會先找出相關的會議片段，再請整理工具回答，回答附上是哪一場會議、哪個時間點。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example: “What prices did we discuss with clients last month?” or “What did we decide about sending email?” Shiyin first finds the relevant parts of your meetings, then asks the summarizer. Answers show which meeting and what time each point comes from."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "依回答修正": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revising with your answers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "停止錄音並開始轉錄（Ctrl+R）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stop recording and start transcribing (Ctrl+R)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全域快捷鍵 Ctrl+Alt+Shift+R：在其他 app 裡也能開始或停止錄音": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Global shortcut Ctrl+Alt+Shift+R: start or stop recording from any app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "公司有拾音的企業伺服器時，填入公司給的網址、按「登入」，在打開的網頁用公司帳號登入。登入後錄音交給公司的伺服器轉錄，沒有 NVIDIA 顯示卡的電腦也很快；整理也可以用公司提供的模型。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If your company runs a Shiyin enterprise server, enter the URL they gave you, click Sign In, and sign in with your company account on the page that opens. Recordings are then transcribed on the company's server — fast even without an NVIDIA graphics card — and summaries can use the company's model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "公司的伺服器還沒登入或登入已失效，請到設定 → 進階 → 企業伺服器登入": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You're not signed in to the company server, or your sign-in has expired. Sign in under Settings → Advanced → Enterprise Server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "公司的伺服器還沒登入或登入已失效：到「進階 → 企業伺服器」登入。設定好之前不會自動整理。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You're not signed in to the company server, or your sign-in has expired. Sign in under Advanced → Enterprise Server. Meetings won't be summarized automatically until this is fixed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "其他": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Other"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切換紀錄、逐字稿、提問": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch between Notes, Transcript, and Ask"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "到逐字稿改名": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rename in Transcript"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "包含錄音、逐字稿、說話者、會議紀錄、筆記和重點標記。傳給同事後，對方雙擊就能匯入拾音。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Includes the recording, transcript, speakers, meeting notes, your notes and bookmarks. A colleague can double-click it to import into Shiyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "匯入錄音、影片、逐字稿或 .shiyin 封包（Ctrl+O）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
