    "匯出 PDF 失敗": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't export the PDF"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "匯出 PDF 需要 Microsoft Edge WebView2 執行階段，這台電腦沒有安裝。可以到微軟的網站下載安裝（免費），或先匯出成 Word。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exporting PDF needs the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime, which isn't installed on this PC. You can download it free from Microsoft, or export to Word instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "即時逐字稿和快速辨識用，約 240 MB。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Used for the live transcript and Quick recognition, about 240 MB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原因：%@\n\n你的資料沒有被改動。升級前的備份在：%@\n請把這個訊息截圖給維護拾音的人。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reason: %@\n\nYour data has not been changed. The backup made before the upgrade is in: %@\nPlease send a screenshot of this message to whoever maintains Shiyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只重新分辨誰在說話，逐字稿的文字不會變。人多、吵雜或手機遠距收音時，告訴拾音大約幾個人會分得比較準。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only works out again who is speaking; the transcript text doesn't change. With many people, a noisy room or a phone recording from across the table, telling Shiyin roughly how many people there are helps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在打開的網頁登入，登入完會回到拾音": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in on the page that opened; you'll come back to Shiyin afterwards"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "執行這個工作時拾音意外結束了 2 次，已經停止自動重試。可以按「重試」再試一次。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin quit unexpectedly twice while running this task, so it won't retry automatically. Click “Retry” to try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "大約幾個人：人多、吵雜或手機放在桌上錄音時，先告訴拾音大約幾個人，說話者會分得比較準": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Roughly how many people: with many people, noise, or a phone on the table, telling Shiyin ahead of time helps it tell speakers apart"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完整的授權條款": {
