    "拾音使用說明": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin Guide"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音幫你把會議變成逐字稿和會議紀錄：錄音時就能看到即時逐字稿，錄完會在這台 Mac 上正式轉錄（中文、英文用 Breeze ASR 25，日文用 Whisper）、分辨說話者，再用 Claude、Codex 或 API 整理成摘要、決議和待辦。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin turns meetings into transcripts and meeting notes. You see a live transcript while recording; afterwards, Shiyin transcribes on this Mac (Breeze ASR 25 for Chinese and English, Whisper for Japanese), identifies speakers, and uses Claude, Codex or an API to write the summary, decisions and action items."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音幫你把會議變成逐字稿和會議紀錄：錄音時就能看到即時逐字稿，錄完會在這台電腦上正式轉錄（中文、英文用 Breeze ASR 25，日文用 Whisper）、分辨說話者，再用 Claude、Codex 或 API 整理成摘要、決議和待辦。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin turns meetings into transcripts and meeting notes: you see a live transcript while recording, then it transcribes on this PC (Breeze ASR 25 for Chinese and English, Whisper for Japanese), tells speakers apart, and uses Claude, Codex or an API to write a summary, decisions and action items."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音把會議變成逐字稿和會議紀錄。錄音、轉錄、說話者辨識都在這台 Mac 上完成。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin turns meetings into transcripts and meeting notes. Recording, transcription and speaker recognition all happen on this Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音把會議變成逐字稿和會議紀錄。錄音、轉錄、說話者辨識都在這台電腦上完成。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin turns meetings into transcripts and meeting notes. Recording, transcription and speaker recognition all happen on this PC."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音是 MIT 授權的開源軟體，用到下列軟體和模型：": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin is open-source software under the MIT License. It uses the following software and models:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音會常駐在工作列右下角的系統匣，關掉視窗也會繼續錄音和整理。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
