        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin wasn't found in the update"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "更新金鑰不符": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "the update key doesn't match"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "替說話者取名時，拾音會記下這個人的聲音特徵。之後的會議認出同一個人，就自動帶入名字並標「自動」，不對可以改。聲音特徵只存在這台 Mac 的資料庫，不會上傳，也不會放進匯出的 .shiyin 封包。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you name a speaker, Shiyin saves that person's voice features. When it recognizes the same person in a later meeting, it fills in the name and marks it “Auto”; you can change it if it's wrong. Voice features stay in the database on this Mac. They're never uploaded or included in exported .shiyin packages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "替說話者取名時，拾音會記下這個人的聲音特徵。之後的會議認出同一個人，就自動帶入名字並標「自動」，不對可以改。聲音特徵只存在這台電腦的資料庫，不會上傳，也不會放進匯出的 .shiyin 封包。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you name a speaker, Shiyin saves that person's voice features. When it recognizes the same person in a later meeting, it fills in the name and marks it Auto; you can change it if it's wrong. Voice features stay in the database on this PC — never uploaded and never included in exported .shiyin packages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "會參考詞彙表，中英夾雜、專有名詞比較準；需要下載約 1.7 GB 的模型。日文會議改用 Whisper large-v3-turbo（574 MB）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses your glossary and handles mixed Chinese and English and proper nouns better; downloads a model of about 1.7 GB. Japanese meetings use Whisper large-v3-turbo (574 MB) instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "會參考詞彙表，多人會議的漏字和同音字比 Breeze 少；阿里巴巴開源的模型，全程在這台電腦上跑、不連網，輸出會轉成台灣繁體；需要下載約 2.5 GB 的模型和 llama.cpp 的執行檔。日文會議改用 Whisper large-v3-turbo（574 MB）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses your glossary; fewer dropped words and homophone errors than Breeze in multi-speaker meetings. An open-source model from Alibaba that runs entirely on this PC without network access; output is converted to Taiwanese Traditional Chinese. Downloads about 2.5 GB of model files plus the llama.cpp program. Japanese meetings use Whisper large-v3-turbo (574 MB) instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "會議可以分資料夾：在會議上按右鍵（或「更多」）選「移到資料夾」→「新資料夾…」。正在看某個資料夾時，新錄的和匯入的會議都會放進去。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meetings can go in folders: right-click a meeting (or use More) and choose Move to folder → New folder…. While you're viewing a folder, new recordings and imports go into it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "會議日期：依各檔案的檔名或修改日期": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeting date: from each file's name or modification date"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 NVIDIA 顯示卡、選了 Qwen3-ASR 時自動下載，Qwen 的轉錄會快很多。272 MB，解開約 610 MB（llama.cpp 官方的 CUDA 版，要先有上面的 NVIDIA 顯示卡加速）。刪除後不會再自動下載。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloaded automatically when you have an NVIDIA GPU and choose Qwen3-ASR; makes Qwen transcription much faster. 272 MB, about 610 MB unpacked (the official llama.cpp CUDA build; requires the NVIDIA GPU acceleration above). It is not downloaded again after you delete it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 NVIDIA 顯示卡時自動下載，轉錄會快很多。685 MB，解開約 1.1 GB（whisper.cpp 官方的 CUDA 版）。刪除後不會再自動下載。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloaded automatically when an NVIDIA GPU is present; transcription is much faster. 685 MB, about 1.1 GB unpacked (the official CUDA build of whisper.cpp). Once deleted, it won't be downloaded automatically again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "標記這個時間點（Ctrl+B），整理時會被當成重點": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mark this moment (Ctrl+B); it's treated as a highlight when writing notes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模型只需要下載一次，之後轉錄都不需要網路。可以先按「下一步」，在背景繼續下載；快速辨識的模型下載好就能錄音，正式轉錄的模型下載好之前先用快速辨識。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Models only need to be downloaded once; transcription works offline after that. You can click Next and let them download in the background. Once the quick recognition model is ready you can record, and Quick recognition is used until the transcription model is ready."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "歡迎使用拾音": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welcome to Shiyin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在下載%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloading %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在下載更新，完成後拾音會自動重新打開": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloading the update. Shiyin will reopen when it's done."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在錄音，要結束拾音嗎？": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording in progress. Quit Shiyin?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每天送一份匿名的使用統計給拾音的開發者：版本、系統、錄音和轉錄了幾分鐘、用了哪些功能、失敗幾次。不會送會議標題、逐字稿、會議紀錄、人名、聲紋或任何檔案。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once a day, Shiyin sends its developer an anonymous summary: version, system, minutes recorded and transcribed, which features were used, and how many tasks failed. It never sends meeting titles, transcripts, notes, names, voiceprints or any files."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每天送一份匿名的使用統計給拾音的開發者：版本、系統、錄音和轉錄了幾分鐘、用了哪些功能、失敗幾次和哪一種失敗。不會送會議標題、逐字稿、會議紀錄、人名、聲紋或任何檔案。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once a day, Shiyin sends its developer an anonymous summary: version, system, minutes recorded and transcribed, which features were used, and how many tasks failed and of what kind. It never sends meeting titles, transcripts, notes, names, voiceprints or any files."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "沒有權限替換「%@」裡的拾音，已經打開下載好的 DMG，請把拾音拖進「應用程式」取代舊版": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin can't replace the app in “%@”. The downloaded DMG is open; drag Shiyin to Applications to replace the old version."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "沒辦法刪除認證管理員裡的 key（錯誤代碼 %lld）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't delete the key from Credential Manager (error %lld)"
